The Lola Sayu defense fleet first appeared in "[[The Citadel (episode)|The Citadel]],"<ref name="The Citadel" /> the eighteenth episode of the animated television series ''[[Star Wars: The Clone Wars]]''{{'}} [[The Clone Wars: Season Three|third season]], which aired on [[February 18]], [[2011]].<ref name="Citadel Ep Guide">{{SWArchive|url=theclonewars/guide/episode318.html|text=''The Clone Wars'' Episode Guide: The Citadel}}</ref>

